<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi Eastern Cement Q1 pre-tax profit slides.</title>
<headline>Saudi Eastern Cement Q1 pre-tax profit slides.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-04-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	    53.5   vs    70.5</p>
<p> Sales income		50.6   vs    69.0</p>
<p> Expenses		     4.4   vs    same</p>
<p> Net operating income    46.1   vs    64.5</p>
<p> Other income		 7.3   vs     6.0</p>
<p> Shareholders' funds  1,103.9   vs 1,073.9</p>
<p> Assets		   1,393.6   vs 1,363.0</p>
<p>Full Name: The Eastern Province Cement Company.</p>
<p>Note - The Dammam-based firm, traded on the Saudi stock market, is one of eight cement companies operating in Saudi Arabia.</p>
</text>
